From: mocha device tree
Subject: [PATCH] libstagefright: skip the broken NVIDIA H.264 OMX encoder

OMX.Nvidia.h264.encoder comes from a vendor libnvomx.so built for older
Android. Under Android 14's ACodec its configure sequence queries
OMX_IndexParamVideoAvc and the component returns
InsufficientResources (0x80001000), so configureCodec fails with -12 and
MediaCodec throws a CodecException: neither the camera recorder nor
screenrecord can find a usable video/avc encoder.

The component cannot be removed through configuration: deleting its
entries from media_codecs.xml and media_codecs_performance.xml does not
help, because IOmxStore enumerates components from libnvomx.so itself,
and CodecSeeding then pins the codec with overrideable=0.
debug.stagefright.omx_default_rank does not override it either.

Filter it out while building MediaCodecList so the framework falls back
to OMX.google.h264.encoder (software, up to 2048x2048). Only the
enumeration changes; libnvomx.so and every other Nvidia component
(decoders, the VP8 encoder) stay in place.

diff --git a/media/libstagefright/OmxInfoBuilder.cpp b/media/libstagefright/OmxInfoBuilder.cpp
index 79ffdeb..301df0e 100644
--- a/media/libstagefright/OmxInfoBuilder.cpp
+++ b/media/libstagefright/OmxInfoBuilder.cpp
@@ -154,6 +154,26 @@ status_t OmxInfoBuilder::buildMediaCodecList(MediaCodecListWriter* writer) {
         for (const IOmxStore::NodeInfo &node : role.nodes) {
             const hidl_string& nodeName = node.name;
 
+            /* 【录像修复 2026-11-17】过滤掉 NVIDIA 的 H.264 硬件编码器。
+             * 该组件来自 Android 7/8 时代的 libnvomx.so，在 Android 14 的
+             * ACodec 下 configureCodec 时查询 OMX_IndexParamVideoAvc 会直接
+             * 返回 InsufficientResources(0x80001000)，导致 MediaCodec
+             * 报 CodecException，相机录像 / screenrecord 全部失败。
+             * 注意：尝试过从 media_codecs.xml / media_codecs_performance.xml
+             * 删除该条目、以及调 debug.stagefright.omx_default_rank，都不生效
+             * ——OMXStore 的组件列表来自 libnvomx.so 自身枚举，而 CodecSeeding
+             * 又把它标成 overrideable=0 强行选中。
+             * 因此只能在 MediaCodecList 构建阶段直接跳过它，让 framework
+             * 回落到 OMX.google.h264.encoder（软件编码，最高 2048x2048）。
+             * 只影响枚举，不动 vendor 的 libnvomx.so，其它 Nvidia 组件
+             * （解码器、VP8 编码器）不受影响。 */
+            if (nodeName == "OMX.Nvidia.h264.encoder") {
+                ALOGI("skipping %s: broken on this vendor OMX blob "
+                      "(configure always reports InsufficientResources)",
+                      nodeName.c_str());
+                continue;
+            }
+
             // currently image and video encoders use surface input
             if (!mAllowSurfaceEncoders && isVideoOrImage && isEncoder) {
                 ALOGD("disabling %s for media type %s because we are not using OMX input surface",
